Scenario: Assign contact to team as permissioned user
	Koroneiki contacts should be able to be assigned to teams by permissioned users.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	And I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code         | KORAUTO                              |
	| Description  | Test automotive account on koroneiki |
	| Fax Number   | 555-555-1234                         |
	| Name         | Koroneiki Automotive                 |
	| Phone Number | 555-555-5678                         |
	| Region       | United States                        |
	| Status       | Approved                             |
	| Tier         | Regular                              |
	| Website      | www.koroneikiautomotive.com          |
	And I create a team with the name "Development Team" for the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	And I set the permissions for a team with the name "Development Team" to have the following values for a non permissioned user
	| Assign Contact | true |
	And I set the permissions for a contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" to have the following values for a non permissioned user
	| View | true |
	And I set the permissions for the "Team" type contact role "Member" to have the following values for a non permissioned user
	| Assign Contact | true |
	And I assign contacts with the following email addresses to the team "Development Team" as a permissioned user
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	Then the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be assigned the team "Development Team"

Scenario: Assign contact to team as permissioned user via okta id
	Koroneiki contacts should be able to be assigned to teams by permissioned users when permissions are set via okta id.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	And I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code         | KORAUTO                              |
	| Description  | Test automotive account on koroneiki |
	| Fax Number   | 555-555-1234                         |
	| Name         | Koroneiki Automotive                 |
	| Phone Number | 555-555-5678                         |
	| Region       | United States                        |
	| Status       | Approved                             |
	| Tier         | Regular                              |
	| Website      | www.koroneikiautomotive.com          |
	And I create a team with the name "Development Team" for the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	And I set the permissions for a team with the name "Development Team" to have the following values for a non permissioned user
	| Assign Contact | true |
	And I set the permissions for a contact with the okta ID "koroneikicontact1" to have the following values for a non permissioned user
	| View | true |
	And I set the permissions for the "Team" type contact role "Member" to have the following values for a non permissioned user
	| Assign Contact | true |
	And I assign contacts with the following email addresses to the team "Development Team" as a permissioned user
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	Then the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be assigned the team "Development Team"

Scenario: Remove contact from team as permissioned user
	Koroneiki contacts should be able to be removed from teams by permissioned users.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
