	| Assign Contact | true |
	And I assign contacts with the following email addresses to the team "Development Team" as a permissioned user
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And I remove contacts with the following email addresses from the team "Development Team" as a permissioned user
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	Then the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should not be assigned the team "Development Team"

