Scenario: Assign contact to team attempt by newly non permissioned user
	Koroneiki contacts should not be able to be assigned to teams by newly non permissioned users.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
